<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team regarding your experience at {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} airport on,{{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If cleanliness add: -</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to learn about your experience with our <em><strong>Qantas Club/Business/First Lounge </strong></em>facilities prior to your QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} flight.<br />
<br />
We’re committed to being the best airline for business and premium travellers and work hard to make sure all our lounges maintain the highest standards of cleanliness.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I’ve taken immediate steps to address this with our staff and cleaning contractors to ensure our standards are met and maintained.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience&nbsp;— I hope that we can make you more comfortable next time you visit our lounge.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If general facilities add: -</em></strong><br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear about your experience with the <strong><em>chairs/computers/upholstery</em></strong> in our <strong><em>Qantas Club/Business/First Lounge</em></strong> prior to your flight QF{{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}}.<br />
<br />
We place a high priority on the quality of everything we provide onboard, and our Lounge Product team put care and thought into choosing <strong><em>furniture/lighting/a colour scheme</em></strong> that appeals to a broad a range of tastes.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed your feedback on to the relevant team for future improvement.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience&nbsp;— I hope that we can make you more comfortable next time you visit our lounge.</p>
